outputs/**/test-artifacts/
outputs/**/exploratory/
outputs/**/exploratory-findings.json
outputs/**/playwright-summary.md
outputs/**/test-results.json
outputs/**/test-analysis.parsed.json
outputs/**/allure-results/
outputs/**/allure-report/
# NÃO ignorar (gerados mas devem ser versionados):
# - outputs/**/reports/      (Markdown self-contained com cópia dos artifacts)
# - outputs/**/triage-report.md  (decisão QA)
# - outputs/**/bug-reports.json  +  outputs/**/bug-reports/  (bug-reports gerados)

